dengai licensing
================

This repository contains two layers of work, under different terms.

1. Original work: PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0
   (SPDX: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0)

   Required Notice: Copyright (c) 2026-present Sudono Tanjung (https://github.com/sudtanj)

   All code in this repository authored by Sudono Tanjung is source-available
   under the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0, the full text of which is
   in LICENSE-POLYFORM-NONCOMMERCIAL.md.

   In plain words:
     - FREE for personal use: running it for yourself, studying it,
       hobby projects, research, education and experimentation.
       Noncommercial organisations (charities, schools, public research
       bodies) are covered too, as the license defines.
     - NOT free for commercial use. Using it in or for a business,
       offering it as a (hosted) service, bundling it into a commercial
       product, or using it to make money in any way needs a paid
       commercial license from the copyright holder.
     - Redistribution must keep this notice and the license text.

   COMMERCIAL LICENSES: contact the copyright holder via
   https://www.linkedin.com/in/sudtanj/ or https://github.com/sudtanj.

2. Ported logic: Apache License 2.0
   Parts of dengai's logic are ports (re-implementations in Rust) of:
     - ArchiSteamFarm (https://github.com/JustArchiNET/ArchiSteamFarm),
       Copyright 2015-2026 Lukasz "JustArchi" Domeradzki and contributors:
       the badge-page parsing used for card farming (src/badges.rs) and the
       handling of the free-license web endpoint's replies (src/purchase.rs).
     - FreePackages (https://github.com/Citrinate/FreePackages),
       Copyright Citrinate and contributors: the free-package filter rules
       (src/pics.rs).
   Both are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, reproduced in
   LICENSE-APACHE. Those portions remain available under the Apache License
   2.0 as well; this file does not change that license or the rights it
   gives. See NOTICE.

